1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,560
That's eight pounds.

2
00:00:01,590 --> 00:00:03,760
I've only got two pounds.

3
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:06,310
Forty pages, twenty p a page.

4
00:00:06,410 --> 00:00:07,770
Then print ten.

5
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:09,680
Ten isn't a form.

6
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:12,200
It's for a care home. Nights.

7
00:00:12,230 --> 00:00:13,470
You're fifteen.

8
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:15,180
Sixteen in March.

9
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:17,090
And nights pay more.

10
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:19,120
Then take the nights.

11
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:21,270
You're not telling me no.

12
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,180
I'm not your mother.

13
00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:25,430
Who pays the eight pounds.

14
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:27,020
You do. Friday.

15
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:28,660
Forty pages.
